  "slug": "find-the-maximum-divisibility-score",
  "title": "找出可整除性得分最大的整数",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-042",
  "studyTags": [
    "数组",
    "枚举"
  ],
  "summary": "除数的可整除性得分是 nums 中能被它整除的元素数，返回得分最大除数；平局取数值最小者。",
  "insight": "直接枚举每个 divisor 并扫描 nums 计数。更新条件按 (score 更大) 或 (score 相同且 divisor 更小) 即可完整表达排序规则。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "除数数组可能不是有序的",
    "平局比较除数本身而非下标",
    "所有得分可能都为零"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "enumerate-divisors-and-count",
      "title": "枚举除数统计整除数",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "对每个候选独立计算得分。",
      "steps": [
        "bestScore=-1，answer=最大整数",
        "遍历 divisor",
        "count nums 中 value%divisor==0",
        "若 count>bestScore 或平局且 divisor<answer，更新",
        "返回 answer"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(nums.length * divisors.length)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/enumerate-divisors-and-count/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/enumerate-divisors-and-count/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/enumerate-divisors-and-count/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
